// spar-log: logging for Spar.
//
// Spar has no re-exports, so import what you need from its own file
// (consumers add the package with `spar add log path:../spar-log` and import
// from "log/<folder>/<file>"):
//
//   core/logger.spar    Logger, checkedLogger
//   core/config.spar    LoggerConfig, validateConfig
//   core/level.spar     LogLevel, levelRank, levelAtLeast
//   core/field.spar     LogField, strField, intField, floatField, boolField
//   core/record.spar    LogRecord
//   sink/sink.spar      Sink, SinkKind, consoleSink, fileSink, memorySink, customSink
//   format/formatter.spar Formatter, FormatStyle, prettyFormatter, compactFormatter,
//                         structuredFormatter, formatRecord
